--[[
	KRHUB  -  Luna Interface Suite edition   (executor script)

	UI: Luna Interface Suite by Nebula Softworks
	    https://github.com/Nebula-Softworks/Luna-Interface-Suite

	Tabs:
	  Teleport - type a username / display name. Teleport, Spectate and ESP
	             controls act on the matched player.
	  Friends  - pick one of your Roblox friends in this server from the
	             dropdown, then Teleport / Spectate / ESP them.
	  Misc     - ESP everyone, name tags, freecam, anti-AFK, walk speed.
	  Tools    - noclip, fly (+ speed), click teleport.
	  VC       - voice chat button.

	Controls:
	  - P toggles freecam (WASD, E/Q, hold right mouse to look, Shift = faster,
	    scroll = speed)
	  - Luna's own window buttons minimize / close the window

	NOTE: Luna is loaded with loadstring(game:HttpGet(...)), so this must be
	run from an executor, not as a LocalScript in StarterPlayerScripts.

	ESP state lives in plain tables (espOn / espAll), completely separate
	from the UI, so closing the window never touches it.
]]

local Players          = game:GetService("Players")
local UserInputService = game:GetService("UserInputService")
local RunService       = game:GetService("RunService")
local VirtualUser      = game:GetService("VirtualUser")

local player = Players.LocalPlayer

print("script ran")

